#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:1
msgid "Microphone Control"
msgstr "マイクコントロール"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:3
msgid ""
"The microphone control key allows controlling system audio input volume."
msgstr "マイク制御キーを使用すると、システムのオーディオ入力音量を制御できます。"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:5
msgid ""
"This key only works when the FlexDesigner is running. This key is only "
"present in the Windows version of the FlexDesigner at the moment."
msgstr ""
"このキーは、FlexDesigner の実行中にのみ機能します。このキーは、現時点では Windows バージョンの FlexDesigner "
"にのみ存在します。"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:7
msgid "![1745502389085](image/microphone_control/1745502389085.png)"
msgstr "![1745502389085](image/microphone_control/1745502389085.png)"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:7
msgid "1745502389085"
msgstr "1745502389085"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:9
msgid "In the FlexDesigner"
msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:11
msgid ""
"Other than the standard visual options, this key doesn't have any additional"
" configurable functions in the FlexDesigner."
msgstr "標準のビジュアル オプション以外に、このキーには FlexDesigner で追加の構成可能な機能はありません。"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:13
msgid "On the Flexbar"
msgstr "Flexbar 上で"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/microphone_control.md:15
msgid ""
"Drag the slider on the Flexbar to adjust system input volume (typically "
"microphone volume)."
msgstr "Flexbar のスライダーをドラッグして、システム入力音量 (通常はマイクの音量) を調整します。"
